<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Prompts</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we provide desensitized versions of various prompts, as the original prompts contain confidential information. These prompts are integral to different components of our framework and evaluation process:</p>
</div>
<div id="A3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="A3.I1" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="A3.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A3.T3" title="Table 3 ‣ Appendix C Prompts ‣ Teaching LLM to be Persuasive: Reward-Enhanced Policy Optimization for Alignment from Heterogeneous Rewards" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> presents the prompt for the Reward Judge, which assesses nuanced behaviors such as SOP compliance, emotional value, and persuasion quality.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A3.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix C Prompts ‣ Teaching LLM to be Persuasive: Reward-Enhanced Policy Optimization for Alignment from Heterogeneous Rewards" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> provides the prompt for the Policy Model, which generates outputs during negotiation tasks.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A3.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix C Prompts ‣ Teaching LLM to be Persuasive: Reward-Enhanced Policy Optimization for Alignment from Heterogeneous Rewards" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> includes the prompt for Deepseek-R1, used to evaluate the growth of negotiation skills during model training.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A3.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="A3.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A3.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ Appendix C Prompts ‣ Teaching LLM to be Persuasive: Reward-Enhanced Policy Optimization for Alignment from Heterogeneous Rewards" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> outlines the prompt for GPT-5, utilized to assess conversation quality in our experiments.</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T3" class="ltx_table ltx_figure_panel ltx_lstlisting ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:345.0pt;">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Reward judge prompt in English.</figcaption>
<p id="A3.T3.2" class="ltx_p ltx_figure_panel"><span id="A3.T3.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Prompt (English)</span></p>
<br class="ltx_break ltx_break">
<div id="A3.T3.3" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="llm_judge_english.txt">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">You</span><span id="lstnumberx1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">are</span><span id="lstnumberx1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">a</span><span id="lstnumberx1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">judge</span><span id="lstnumberx1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">for</span><span id="lstnumberx1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">BD</span><span id="lstnumberx1.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">(</span><span id="lstnumberx1.14" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">business</span><span id="lstnumberx1.15" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.16" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">development</span><span id="lstnumberx1.17" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">)</span><span id="lstnumberx1.18" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.19" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">quality</span><span id="lstnumberx1.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.21" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">control</span><span id="lstnumberx1.22" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.23" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">on</span><span id="lstnumberx1.24" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.25" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">a</span><span id="lstnumberx1.26" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.27" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">travel</span><span id="lstnumberx1.28" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.29" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">platform</span><span id="lstnumberx1.30" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.</span><span id="lstnumberx1.31" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.32" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">You</span><span id="lstnumberx1.33" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.34" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">score</span><span id="lstnumberx1.35" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.36" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">negotiation</span><span id="lstnumberx1.37" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.38" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">calls</span><span id="lstnumberx1.39" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.40" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">between</span><span id="lstnumberx1.41" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.42" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx1.43" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.44" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">platform</span><span id="lstnumberx1.45" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.46" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">BD</span><span id="lstnumberx1.47" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.48" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">and</span><span id="lstnumberx1.49" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.50" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx1.51" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.52" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">hotel</span><span id="lstnumberx1.53" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.54" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">representative</span><span id="lstnumberx1.55" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">.</span><span id="lstnumberx1.56" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.57" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">The</span><span id="lstnumberx1.58" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.59" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">core</span><span id="lstnumberx1.60" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.61" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">objective</span><span id="lstnumberx1.62" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.63" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">of</span><span id="lstnumberx1.64" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.65" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx1.66" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.67" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">calls</span><span id="lstnumberx1.68" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.69" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">is</span><span id="lstnumberx1.70" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.71" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">"</span><span id="lstnumberx1.72" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">the</span><span id="lstnumberx1.73" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.74" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">platform</span><span id="lstnumberx1.75" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.76" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">BD</span><span id="lstnumberx1.77" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.78" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">seeks</span><span id="lstnumberx1.79" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.80" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">to</span><span id="lstnumberx1.81" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.82" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">lower</span><span id="lstnumberx1.83" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.84" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">room</span><span id="lstnumberx1.85" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.86" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">prices</span><span id="lstnumberx1.87" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.88" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">to</span><span id="lstnumberx1.89" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx1.90" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">benefit</span><sp