<span id="A3.T6.2.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_p">Does the platform BD correctly understand that they only provide price-change service and not other services; handling other complaints, calling back later, adding WeChat, etc., are outside the scope. Output 1 for yes; 0 for no.</span>
</span></td></tr>
